@startuml UcGoogleAuth

title Authentication — GoogleAuthUseCase (visión general)

skinparam activityBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam activityBorderColor #888888
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF9C4
skinparam activityArrowColor #555555
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam noteBorderColor #F9A825

start

:Recibir GoogleAuthCommand\n(email, googleSub, username);

-> Fase 1;
:uc-google-auth-identify.puml\n**Identificar usuario** (LoadUserPort);

-> Fase 2 (si aplica);
:uc-google-auth-provision.puml\n**Provisionar usuario** (crear / vincular + ToS);

-> Fase 3;
:uc-google-auth-tokens.puml\n**Emitir tokens JWT** (TokenGeneratorPort);

:Retornar AuthTokenResponse\n(accessToken, refreshToken);

stop

@enduml
